<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>申報 - THE SHENG PAO (1939-03-20)</title>
<style>
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  body {
    background-color: #d8ceb9;
    color: #1a1612;
    font-family: "Noto Serif TC", "Songti SC", "SimSun", "Times New Roman", serif;
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .newspaper-container {
    width: 920px;
    background-color: #eae0c8;
    border: 3px solid #2b241b;
    box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    padding: 15px 20px 20px 20px;
  }

  /* Top Header Bar */
  .header-bar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    border-bottom: 3px solid #2b241b;
    padding-bottom: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-family: "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .header-bar .date {
    font-size: 16px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .header-bar .title-en {
    font-size: 26px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }
  .header-bar .frequency {
    font-size: 16px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* Main Bordered Grid */
  .main-grid {
    border: 3px solid #2b241b;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  /* Upper Section (Masthead + Top Article) */
  .upper-section {
    display: flex;
    border-bottom: 3px solid #2b241b;
    min-height: 380px;
  }

  /* Masthead (Top Right) */
  .masthead {
    width: 280px;
    border-left: 3px solid #2b241b;
    display: flex;
    padding: 15px 10px;
    justify-content: space-around;
    align-items: center;
    background: #eae0c8;
    order: 2;
  }
  .masthead-title {
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    font-size: 85px;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: 15px;
    font-family: "KaiTi", "BiauKai", "楷體", serif;
  }
  .masthead-dates {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    height: 90%;
    width: 140px;
  }
  .date-box {
    border: 2px solid #2b241b;
    padding: 10px 6px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    direction: rtl;
    unicode-bidi: bidi-override;
  }

  /* Top Article (Left of Masthead) */
  .top-article {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    padding: 15px;
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    order: 1;
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }
  .top-headline {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    margin-left: 15px;
  }
  .top-headline h1 {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: bold;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
  }
  .top-headline h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: bold;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }
  .top-body-main {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .top-left-block {
    writing-mode: horizontal-tb;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    width: 210px;
    margin-right: 15px;
  }
  .top-sub-text {
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    height: 150px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  /* Lower Section */
  .lower-section {
    display: flex;
    min-height: 420px;
  }

  /* Lower Right Article */
  .lower-right-article {
    flex: 1.35;
    display: flex;
    padding: 15px;
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    border-left: 3px solid #2b241b;
    order: 2;
  }
  .lower-headline {
    display: flex;
    margin-left: 15px;
  }
  .lower-headline-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    margin-left: 6px;
  }
  .prefix-bi-shang {
    writing-mode: horizontal-tb;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: bold;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .prefix-bi-shang span {
    padding: 0 2px;
  }
  .lower-headline h2 {
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .lower-headline h3 {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }

  .lower-content-split {
    writing-mode: horizontal-tb;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex: 1;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .lower-top-half {
    display: flex;
    flex: 1;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 2px dotted #4a4035;
  }
  .lower-top-text {
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .lower-photo-wrap {
    width: 145px;
    margin-right: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .lower-bottom-half {
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    padding-top: 12px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    height: 160px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* Bottom Left Section (Bank Directory & Notice) */
  .bottom-left-section {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 15px 12px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    order: 1;
    background: #eae0c8;
  }
  .banks-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row-reverse;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    width: 100%;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .bank-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-around;
    height: 250px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .bank-name {
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
  }
  .nanjing-divider {
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 10px;
    align-self: center;
    margin: 0 4px;
  }
  .notice-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row-reverse;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    border-top: 1px solid transparent;
    padding-top: 10px;
  }
  .notice-item {
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .notice-item.large {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  /* Placeholder Styling */
  .placeholder {
    background-color: #c8beab;
    border: 1px solid #5a5045;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    color: #2b241b;
    font-family: sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    padding: 8px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .photo-upper {
    height: 185px;
  }
  .photo-lower {
    height: 175px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="newspaper-container">
  <!-- Top Header Bar -->
  <div class="header-bar">
    <div class="date">MARCH 20th 1939</div>
    <div class="title-en">THE SHENG PAO</div>
    <div class="frequency">PUBLISHED DAILY</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Newspaper Grid -->
  <div class="main-grid">

    <!-- UPPER SECTION -->
    <div class="upper-section">
      <!-- Top Article (Left) -->
      <div class="top-article">
        <div class="top-headline">
          <h1>新政府經濟司要員明樓抵滬</h1>
          <h2>攜弟明誠履新 主持物資統制事宜</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="top-body-main">
          【本報上海訊】新政府經濟司要員明樓<br>
          氏昨日抵滬，隨行者有其弟明誠。據悉，<br>
          明氏將主持華東物資統制事宜，並兼任<br>
          特務委員會副主任。明誠則出任經濟司
        </div>

        <div class="top-left-block">
          <div class="placeholder photo-upper">
            [Photo: Two men in suits walking at night, Ming Lou and Ming Cheng]
          </div>
          <div class="top-sub-text">
            秘書處長，<br>
            協助其兄處<br>
            理日常公務。<br>
            明氏兄弟抵<br>
            滬後，已拜<br>
            會各方要員，<br>
            近期將正式<br>
            開展工作。
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Masthead (Right) -->
      <div class="masthead">
        <div class="masthead-dates">
          <div class="date-box">中華民國三十八年</div>
          <div class="date-box">西曆一千九百三十九年</div>
          <div class="date-box">三月二十號 星期一</div>
        </div>
        <div class="masthead-title">申報</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- LOWER SECTION -->
    <div class="lower-section">
      <!-- Lower Right Article -->
      <div class="lower-right-article">
        <div class="lower-headline">
          <div class="lower-headline-col">
            <div class="prefix-bi-shang">
              <span>比</span><span>商</span>
            </div>
            <h2>有利銀公司今日開幕</h2>
          </div>
          <h3>全歐抗聯會致函利物浦僑胞</h3>
          <h3>呼籲加緊輸財救國</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="lower-content-split">
          <div class="lower-top-half">
            <div class="lower-top-text">
              【本報巴黎訊】全歐華僑抗日救國聯合會昨致<br>
              函利物浦中國國民抗日救國會，通報國內戰局，<br>
              動員僑胞繼續捐款捐物、抵制日貨。函稱，祖<br>
              國抗戰正值艱難，海外支援不可稍懈，望利物<br>
              浦僑胞再接再厲，共盡救國責任。
            </div>
            <div class="lower-photo-wrap">
              <div class="placeholder photo-lower">
                [Photo: Street scene with traditional Chinese signs and pedestrians]
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="lower-bottom-half">
            閶門石路漸復元氣，菜館茶館<br>
            反較戰前興隆。鄉民紛紛返城，<br>
            北局入夜遊人如織。然物價日<br>
            昂，升門小民謀一飽亦難，<br>
            「天堂」光景終非昔比。
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bottom Left Section (Bank Directory & Notice) -->
      <div class="bottom-left-section">
        <div class="banks-grid">
          <div class="bank-col">
            <span class="bank-name">江蘇銀行</span>
            <span class="bank-name">金城銀行</span>
            <span class="bank-name">浙江興業銀行</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bank-col">
            <span class="bank-name">中國銀行</span>
            <span class="bank-name">大陸銀行</span>
            <span class="bank-name">中國農工銀行</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bank-col">
            <span class="bank-name">中央銀行</span>
            <span class="bank-name">中南銀行</span>
            <span class="bank-name">中國實業銀行</span>
          </div>
          <div class="bank-col">
            <span class="bank-name">交通銀行</span>
            <span class="bank-name">國華銀行</span>
            <span class="bank-name">中國國貨銀行</span>
          </div>
          <div class="nanjing-divider">南京</div>
          <div class="bank-col">
            <span class="bank-name">上海銀行</span>
            <span class="bank-name">興民銀行</span>
            <span class="bank-name">四行儲蓄會</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="notice-row">
          <div class="notice-item large">通告</div>
          <div class="notice-item">休業五日</div>
          <div class="notice-item">三月二十</div>
          <div class="notice-item">五日后</div>
          <div class="notice-item" style="visibility: hidden;">空白</div>
          <div class="notice-item">照常營業</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```
